            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>How to read this</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#6b6f78' fontsize='9'>Brand share is measured against all four brands, so the brand filter hides lines without changing shares. Changes compare the selected months with the same months a year earlier. Barefoot is the remainder brand: read its moves in share points. In the bottom table, a cell is blank when either period has fewer than 50 units, because percentages on numbers that small are mostly noise. Hover over a cell to see its units.</run>
            </formatted-text>
